@startuml 02-session-fork-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1976D2
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #426450ff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderThickness 2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9bd0f5ff
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam noteBorderColor #F57C00
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30

title 会话分叉（fork）流程

actor 调用方 as Caller
participant "SessionStore\n(core/session L791)" as Store
participant "源 Session\n(L424)" as SrcSession
database "源事件日志\n(JSONL/SQLite)" as SrcDB
participant "子 Session\n(新创建)" as ChildSession
database "子事件日志\n(新)" as ChildDB

Caller -> Store: fork(source, boundary?, childSessionId?)
activate Store

Store -> SrcSession: 读取事件流到 boundary
activate SrcSession
SrcSession -> SrcDB: 读取 SessionEvent[]
activate SrcDB
SrcDB --> SrcSession: events[]
deactivate SrcDB
SrcSession --> Store: events[] + header
deactivate SrcSession

Store -> ChildSession: 创建子会话
activate ChildSession
note right of ChildSession
  SessionHeader.parentSession
  记录分叉谱系 (L74)
end note

Store -> ChildDB: 复制事件到子日志
activate ChildDB
ChildDB --> Store: 持久化确认
deactivate ChildDB

Store -> ChildSession: 追加 session/seed 标记
ChildSession --> Store: 子 Session 实例
deactivate ChildSession

Store --> Caller: childSession
deactivate Store

note over Caller, ChildDB
  分叉是事件流的快照复制：
  - 子会话继承到 boundary 为止的事件
  - parentSession 链记录谱系
  - 子会话独立演化，可继续追加
end note
@enduml
